    "en": {
      "trackName": "Dungeon Shelter",
      "description": "Available for iOS and watchOS.\n\nDungeon Shelter is a 2D dungeon management and strategy game where you build, expand, and defend your underground domain against relentless invading heroes.\n\nYou begin with only the essentials: an Entrance Room, where brave (or foolish) heroes enter your dungeon, a mysterious Portal Room that continuously spawns creatures, and a single Barracks to organize your growing forces. From there, it’s up to you to turn a humble cave into a thriving underground fortress.\n\nEvery 30 seconds, the portal opens and unleashes new creatures into your dungeon. These monsters automatically march forward toward the entrance, preparing to intercept the next hero. But heroes also appear regularly, stepping into your dungeon with one goal: to defeat your forces and survive the depths.\n\nWhen a creature encounters a hero, both stop and engage in battle. Each unit has its own hit points, displayed through dynamic green, yellow, and red health bars during combat. Fights continue until one combatant falls. The defeated unit fades away, and the victor continues forward — if they survive.\n\nStrategic placement of rooms is key. Expand your dungeon by building specialized rooms such as:\n\nBarracks – A place to sleep for your creatures.\n\nFood Room – Sustain your growing army.\n\nGold Room - Get the gold you need to finance your expansion.\n\nHealth Room – Let injured creatures recover.\n\nEach room contributes to the efficiency and survival of your dungeon ecosystem. Space is limited, so every decision matters. How will you design your layout? Will you focus on overwhelming heroes with sheer numbers, or carefully manage resources to create unstoppable defenders?\n\nDungeon Shelter combines simple controls with strategic depth. Build wisely, manage your creatures, and watch as your dungeon evolves from a fragile outpost into an impenetrable stronghold.\n\nThe heroes are coming.\nWill your dungeon stand?",
      "releaseNotes": "- Multi-level dungeons\n- New room type\n- Dungeon events",
